[gd_scene format=3]

; The dash strike's own HUD (CbItem.hud on prefabs/dash_strike.tscn, shown while it is carried): one line, its key
; and whether it is ready. What it says is the sheet beside it (dash_strike_hud.rules). Its row is its own:
; the four skills' lines stack at the bottom left.

